     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <div lang=\"x-unicode\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Dear all,</p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">I’m glad to\r\n          (finally!) announce the incorporation in the latest version of\r\n          breedR (0.10-19) of one of the <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/issues/16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/issues/16&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244803054000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kQsnxfEG5FrYCcNvqR6F5\">most\r\n            requested features</a>: the automatic (under certain\r\n          circumstances) computation and reporting of the heritability.</p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Furthermore, I\r\n          added a <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/wiki/Getting-started#breedr-guides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/wiki/Getting-started%23breedr-guides&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244803054000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KFCi9-sl1unz1765EXCSi\">vignette</a>\r\n          on computing heritability. It covers all possible scenarios,\r\n          and the available options (Delta method, simulation from\r\n          asymptotic distributions, and bootstrapping).</p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Comments and\r\n          contributions are welcome, as always.</p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Other <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/blob/master/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/blob/master/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244803054000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37tuCRrA00pf9iD_aRw99i\">news</a>\r\n          include another vignette on handling missing values, a direct\r\n          interface to PROGSF90 options (giving more control on the REML\r\n          process), and a new mechanism for installing breedR which\r\n          brings several advantages (more on that later).</p>\r\n        <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Best wishes<br>\r\n          ƒacu.-</p>\r\n        <div title=\"MDH:RGVhciBhbGwsPGJyPjxicj5JJ20gZ2xhZCB0byAoZmluYWxseSEpIGFubm91bmNlIHRoZSBpbmNvcnBvcmF0aW9uIG9mIG9uZSBvZiB0aGUgW21vc3QgcmVxdWVzdGVkIGZlYXR1cmVzXShodHRwczov\r\nL2dpdGh1Yi5jb20vZmFtdXZpZS9icmVlZFIvaXNzdWVzLzE2KTogdGhlIGF1dG9tYXRpYyAodW5k\r\nZXIgY2VydGFpbiBjaXJjdW1zdGFuY2VzKSBjb21wdXRhdGlvbiBhbmQgcmVwb3J0aW5nIG9mIHRo\r\nZSBoZXJpdGFiaWxpdHkuPGJyPjxicj5GdXJ0aGVybW9yZSwgSSBhZGRlZCBhIFt2aWduZXR0ZV0o\r\naHR0cHM6Ly9naXRodWIuY29tL2ZhbXV2aWUvYnJlZWRSL3dpa2kvR2V0dGluZy1zdGFydGVkI2Jy\r\nZWVkci1ndWlkZXMpIG9uIGNvbXB1dGluZyBoZXJpdGFiaWxpdHkuIEl0IGNvdmVycyBhbGwgcG9z\r\nc2libGUgc2NlbmFyaW9zLCBhbmQgdGhlIGF2YWlsYWJsZSBvcHRpb25zIChEZWx0YSBtZXRob2Qs\r\nIHNpbXVsYXRpb24gZnJvbSBhc3ltcHRvdGljIGRpc3RyaWJ1dGlvbnMsIGFuZCBib290c3RyYXBw\r\naW5nKS48YnI+PGJyPkNvbW1lbnRzIGFuZCBjb250cmlidXRpb25zIGFyZSB3ZWxjb21lLCBhcyBh\r\nbHdheXMuPGJyPjxicj5PdGhlciBbbmV3c10oaHR0cHM6Ly9naXRodWIuY29tL2ZhbXV2aWUvYnJl\r\nZWRSL2Jsb2IvbWFzdGVyL05FV1MpIGluY2x1ZGUgYW5vdGhlciB2aWduZXR0ZSBvbiBoYW5kbGlu\r\nZyBtaXNzaW5nIHZhbHVlcywgYSBkaXJlY3QgaW50ZXJmYWNlIHRvIFBST0dTRjkwIG9wdGlvbnMg\r\nKGdpdmluZyBtb3JlIGNvbnRyb2wgb24gdGhlIFJFTUwgcHJvY2VzcyksIGFuZCBhIG5ldyBtZWNo\r\nYW5pc20gZm9yIGluc3RhbGxpbmcgYnJlZWRSIHdoaWNoIGJyaW5ncyBzZXZlcmFsIGFkdmFudGFn\r\nZXMgKG1vcmUgb24gdGhhdCBsYXRlcikuPGJyPjxicj5CZXN0IHdpc2hlczxicj7CoMKgwqAgwqDC\r\n\r\n          oMKgIMaSYWN1Li08YnI+PGJyPg==\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
